## about myself

hello... it's yareli. 21. any/all. black. burnt out graphic design undergraduate. depending on where you've met me on the internet, i also go by frissyn, berrymyre, and alaira. this website is where i collect and publish all my writing on video games, anime, manga, personal stuff, and whatever else i might not've posted to twitter first. thanks a bunch for stopping by!

